-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">track record, trust and brand recognition.</span></div></div><p style="text-indent:6.667%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The online educational product market is rapidly evolving and highly competitive. We believe the principal competitive factors in our business include the following:</span></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:6.667%;display:flex;margin-top:10pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.571084182443509%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">ability to rapidly adapt and develop products that meet student needs within the latest regulatory environment;</span></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:6.667%;display:flex;margin-top:10pt;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.571084182443509%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">overal